automate bass.cutoff
500 R:16 700:32@exp 1400:64@exp 450:0.1@step R:31.9 1600:32@exp 1900:16@exp 1200:8@exp 500:8@exp

# ---- lead: answers the choir. Bar 1 of each chord belongs to the sung
# note; the lead enters on a pickup into bar 2. One cell — two sixteenths
# into a long note — carries the whole line while its pitches develop:
# stated, raised a third, turned into a descent, lifted a sixth to E5 for
# the peak, then brought home to A. ----
track lead patch=claude-drive vel=0.7 len=1 gain=0.9 reverb_send=0.3
>A
R:3.5 G4:0.25@0.5 A4:0.25@0.55 | B4:0.25@0.5 C5:1.75 R:0.5 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:1 | R:1 E5:1.5@0.75 D5:0.5 C5:1 | A4:1.5 R:2.5
